--- a/packages/connector/README.md
+++ b/packages/connector/README.md
@@ -4,6 +4,12 @@ The Node 24 LTS connector collects exact aggregate token counters from supported
 sources and pairs them with Vibe Racing agent accounts. It never uploads raw sessions or local
 paths.
 
+The connector protocol module validates bounded JSON responses before consumers use them. A valid
+non-success response rejects with an `Error` whose `status` is the HTTP status and whose `code` is
+the validated server error code. Invalid, oversized, malformed, non-JSON, or terminal-control-
+containing responses reject as `invalid_server_response`; they are never treated as trusted server
+errors. The CLI request path uses these fields to preserve cleanup, retry, and quarantine behavior.
+
 ```bash
 npx --yes --prefer-online --package https://viberacing.example/downloads/viberacing-connector.tgz -- \
   viberacing connect --origin https://viberacing.example
